  "instructions": [
    "preheat oven to 400f.",
    "season the cod fillets with salt, black pepper, and chili powder.",
    "heat the vegetable oil in an oven-safe skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "add the minced garlic and sauté for another minute.",
    "add the smoked paprika, ground cumin, and apple cider vinegar, stir to combine.",
    "add the cod fillets and sear for 2-3 minutes on each side.",
    "transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 8-10 minutes, or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "top the fish with shredded cheese and chopped cilantro, and return to the oven for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "remove the skillet from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes before serving."
  ],
